%e A401874   ...
%e A401874 In the following graph on 4 vertices and diameter 2 all vertices are eccentric. Vertices 2 and 3 are peripheral, but vertices 1 and 4 are also eccentric since they are at maximum distance from each other.
%e A401874      1 --- 2
%e A401874      |  \  |
%e A401874      3 --- 4
